# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# Both values are safe to expose in a browser. The anon (publishable) key only
# grants what row-level security allows, which in this app is "your own rows plus
# the curated food and symptom libraries". The service-role key is not used
# anywhere in this codebase and must never be added here.
#
# Leaving these blank is a supported setup: the app runs in local-only mode,
# storing everything in the browser, and hides sign-in entirely. `git clone &&
# npm install && npm run dev` works with no Supabase project at all.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
